packs/claudinite-dashboard/VERSIONS.md:19:| 60902.10 | 2026-09-02 | The page-side reads the redesign's figures rest on (#1604), all of them reductions over responses the page already fetches — the viewer makes no new request. The issues listing's PR projection now keeps a **merged** PR inside a 14-day window, with its merge date and the issue it closes parsed before the body is dropped, so the lead-time series covers the days the fold has not reached; a complete open listing no longer discards them. New `pricing.mjs` prices a window's `tokensByModel` against the deployment's `rates` table — per model, per counter, cache creation falling back to the input rate — and keeps three states apart: a number, *unpriced* (no table, and the key is named), and a priced sum with an unpriced remainder that is never folded into it. The scheduler heartbeat is topped up from the fold's hour tier, so a member whose last scheduler run is older than one page of runs stops reading as one that has never run — the critical verdict. `fleetCorpus` gains the fleet mean of rule tokens per session, averaged over members rather than pooled, with the member count beside it. And `wakeStrip` buckets the roster's next asks into the coming 24 UTC hours, placing a held task at now rather than dropping it. The cache's stored-shape version moves with the PR projection. |
